# Reference grammar: tutorials/regression/lib.sh.
# error <field> <norm> <expected> <tolerance>
# Case defaults with -seedProfile curvedFront: N 10, Pe_L 46, gmsh 4.15.2, seed 1. Tolerances
# cover the spread over gmsh mesh seeds 1 to 4.
error  eps        L2  0.012174457  0.0082
error  eps_bulk   L2  0.012102492  0.0081
error  eps_wall   L2  0.0010218576  0.0016
error  grad_bulk  L2  0.068243802  0.0023
